      "source": "memory",
      "snippet": "# Memory — 2026-03-01 ## Agent Squad Setup Jesse has 8 agents configured in OpenClaw: - **Orbit** (me) — Command/coordinator 🛸 - **Baymax** — Health 🤖 - **Beast** — Learning/Research 📚 - **Green Lantern** — Creativity, Blender, worldbuilding 🟢 - **Qui-Gon** — Wellness/mindfulness 🧘 - **Rick** — Genius, blunt 🔬 - **Thanos** — Productivity/work 👊 - **Tony Stark** — Business/investing 💰 ## Cross-Agent Messaging Fix Problem: Orbit couldn't ping other agents (Beast, Green Lantern, etc.) Fix: Added `tools.sessions.visibility` and `agentToAgent` to `~/.openclaw/openclaw.json` ```json \"tools\": { \"sessions\": { \"visibility\": \"all\" }, \"agentToAgent\": true } ``` Placed at the top",
