      "snippet": "# Memory — Saturday March 14, 2026 ## Mission Control Dashboard — Built Today ### What we built - Full local dashboard at `localhost:3131` (Node/Express + vanilla JS SPA) - Files: `workspace-main/dashboard/server.js`, `dashboard/index.html` - Data source: `workspace-main/agent-tasks.json` ### Features - Home grid — 8 agent cards with real avatars, skills, progress bars, task lists - Agent detail pages — full kanban board (Queue / In Progress / Done) with drag-and-drop - Inline task edit (✏️) and delete (🗑️) on kanban cards - Checkbox-only toggle on home cards (not full row click) - Notes system — saves to both `agent-tasks.json` AND each agent's `workspace-{agent}/NOTES.md` - Tasks also",
